 "remarks": "Rarely does a home in this coveted pocket of Greenwich come to market. This beautifully expanded seven-bedroom residence offers turnkey living on a private one-acre lot on a quiet cul-de-sac. A two-story foyer sets the tone, opening to sun-filled living spaces designed for both grand entertaining and everyday ease. The gourmet kitchen, appointed with granite countertops, a professional-grade Wolf range, stainless steel appliances, skylights, and a generous center island, flows effortlessly into the family room at the heart of the home.  The serene primary suite is complete with a dressing room, walk-in closet, and spa-inspired bath, while heated towel warmers grace three full bathrooms. A finished lower level offers refined flexibility as a media lounge, gym, or in-law suite.  Outdoors, a stone patio and custom outdoor cooking station with a built-in grill and griddle make entertaining and everyday dining a pleasure in every season. Central air, a heated two-car garage, and impeccable attention to comfort throughout complete this rare offering in one of Greenwich's most desirable enclaves.  Conveniently located in close proximity to schools, restaurants, and train stations.",
